  "colorCriterion": "VETNEB colours are read as the browser paints them: each computed colour (rgb, oklab, oklch, color(srgb), including any color-mix() already resolved by the engine) is composited by a 2D canvas over the painted background stack of its ancestors and read back as 8-bit sRGB. A colour is IGUAL when every channel differs from Drive by <= 2 and alpha by <= 0.01. Never a textual comparison."
